sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Finance User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API
  participant DB
  participant Metrics

  User->>UI: click Export
  UI->>API: GET /invoices/export
  API->>API: check role == finance (SPEC-0001-R03)
  alt not finance
    API-->>UI: 403 forbidden
    API->>Metrics: export_forbidden_total++
  else is finance
    API->>API: check rate limit (SPEC-0001-R05)
    alt over quota
      API-->>UI: 429 Retry-After
      API->>Metrics: export_rate_limited_total++
    else under quota
      API->>DB: SELECT invoices
      DB-->>API: invoice rows
      API->>API: serialize CSV (SPEC-0001-R02, R04, R06)
      API->>Metrics: invoices_exported_total++, export_latency_seconds
      API-->>UI: 200 text/csv
      UI-->>User: file download
    end
  end
